WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.938
Your resume is private.

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.875
So who gets to read it?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.775
Your job hunt shouldn't be a full-time job.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.827
Fit scores and the chat need a model.

00:00:15.827 --> 00:00:18.525
In Settings, you choose where it runs.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.225
Claude's API gives the strongest scores.

00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:27.659
Antigravity uses your own Google subscription.

00:00:27.659 --> 00:00:31.465
Or a model runs on your computer, free and private.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.191
Set a backup order.

00:00:33.191 --> 00:00:38.025
If one runs out of credit or is down, the next one scores the job.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.257
A daily cap keeps the bill bounded.

00:00:42.257 --> 00:00:44.925
Past it, the fallback scores the rest.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.706
Only the model you pick sees your resume and the postings.

00:00:50.706 --> 00:00:53.835
With a model on your computer, nothing leaves.
